<title>POLAND: PPWK Q2 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>PPWK Q2 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPWK SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			2.74  vs     2.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  2.94  vs     2.42</p>
<p>    net profit				1.82  vs     1.67</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polskie Przedsiebiorstwo Wydawnictw Kartograficznych SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 9.46  vs     7.38</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  4.64  vs     3.66</p>
<p>@</p>
